sequenceDiagram
title Dispatch Sequence
actor Operator
participant Orchestrator
participant Dispatch
participant Workspace
participant AgentBridge
participant Tracker
participant Codex

Operator->>Orchestrator: Start or reconfigure service
Orchestrator->>Dispatch: Ask for next runnable issue
Dispatch->>Tracker: Fetch active candidate issues
Tracker-->>Dispatch: Issue state + metadata
Dispatch-->>Orchestrator: Transition + dispatch decision
Orchestrator->>Workspace: Create or reuse issue workspace
Workspace-->>Orchestrator: Workspace path
Orchestrator->>AgentBridge: Start agent run in workspace
AgentBridge->>Codex: Open session and send prompt
Codex-->>AgentBridge: Tool calls / completion events
AgentBridge->>Tracker: Persist comments or issue updates via tools
AgentBridge-->>Orchestrator: Dispatch complete / retry signal
